---DNSSEC Algorithm
---3: DSA
---5: RSASHA1
---6: DSA-NSEC3-SHA1
---7: RSASHA1-NSEC3-SHA1
---8: RSASHA256
---10: RSASHA512
---12: ECC-GOST
---13: ECDSAP256SHA256
---14: ECDSAP384SHA384
---15: ED25519
---16: ED448
---@alias ovh.domain.DnssecKeyAlgorithmEnum 3|5|6|7|8|10|12|13|14|15|16

---DNSSEC Key Flag Type: 256=ZSK (Zone Signing Key), 257=KSK (Key Signing Key)
